    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "生成中的认识经内容、实际根据、相关错误和可修订标准形成；G0 与公开 J1–J4/E 连接其生活意义。选择性修订区分唯一／冗余根据丧失、冲突、目的变化与共同重编码；常规根据维护在同一接口内匹配，复制错误仍保留。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing forms through content, actual grounds, relevant error and revisable standards; G0 and explicit J1–J4/E connect its place in living. Selective revision distinguishes sole/redundant support loss, conflict, purpose change and joint recoding; conventional support maintenance matches within the same interface, with copied error retained.",
    "scope_zh": "已执行有界形式／计算比较：新增16项 Lean 定理、32项声明审计及1,296项模型记录；共同接口所有状态及有限历史中等价。既有哲学候选、原典比较与四项数据统计量复核保持原范围；无新人／动物实验或独立 agent 验收。下一连接是获得的来源／共同脆弱性辨别怎样支持有根据、可修正的信赖；普遍语义、意识及整套理论必要性仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "Bounded formal/computational comparison executed: 16 new Lean theorems, 32 declaration audits and 1,296 model cases; equivalence covers every state and finite history of the common interface. Prior philosophical, primary-source and four-statistic findings retain their scopes. No new human/animal experiment or independent-agent acceptance. Next: acquired access/shared-vulnerability distinctions into warranted revisable reliance. Universal semantics, consciousness and whole-theory necessity remain open.",
