    "claim_zh": "生成中的认识经内容、实际根据、相关错误和可修订标准形成；G0 与公开 J1–J4/E 连接其生活意义。选择性修订已有常规实现；新接续从探测获得来源依存判断，在覆盖条件下形成可靠答案，保留复制、共同脆弱性及联合失效的不同后果。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing forms through content, actual grounds, relevant error and revisable standards; G0 and explicit J1–J4/E connect its place in living. Selective revision admits a conventional realization; the new continuation acquires production dependencies from probes and supports correct answers under coverage, distinguishing copying, shared vulnerability and joint failure.",
    "scope_zh": "新增26项 Lean 定理／53项声明审计、576项模型记录；实际路线与失效被覆盖时，明确答案正确。六项校准仍容许遗漏的联合失效；额外探测排除旧模型族。既有16／32选择性修订、哲学候选及四项统计量复核保持原范围。无新人／动物实验或独立验收；下一连接是模型族与推展范围的有据修订。普遍语义、意识及整套理论必要性仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "26 new Lean theorems/53 declaration audits and 576 model cases; definite answers are correct when the actual route and fault are covered. Six-probe calibration still permits an omitted joint failure, exposed by another probe. Prior 16/32 selective-revision, philosophical and four-statistic results keep their scopes. No new human/animal experiment or independent acceptance. Next: evidence-guided revision of model families and transfer scope. Universal semantics, consciousness and whole-theory necessity remain open.",
